usage: ideal-poly-optimize [-h] --vertices VERTICES [--trials TRIALS]
                           [--maxiter MAXITER] [--popsize POPSIZE]
                           [--workers WORKERS] [--output OUTPUT] [--seed SEED]

Optimize ideal polyhedron volumes

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --vertices VERTICES, -v VERTICES
                        Number of vertices (must be >= 4)
  --trials TRIALS, -t TRIALS
                        Number of optimization trials (default: 10)
  --maxiter MAXITER, -m MAXITER
                        Max iterations per trial (default: 200)
  --popsize POPSIZE, -p POPSIZE
                        SciPy population multiplier (default: 15)
  --workers WORKERS, -w WORKERS
                        Worker processes; -1 uses all CPUs (default: 1)
  --output OUTPUT, -o OUTPUT
                        Output JSON file (default: results/data/{n}vertex_opti
                        mization_cli_TIMESTAMP.json)
  --seed SEED, -s SEED  Random seed base (default: 42)

Examples:
  ideal-poly-optimize --vertices 7 --trials 10
  ideal-poly-optimize --vertices 12 --trials 20 --maxiter 300
  ideal-poly-optimize --vertices 20 --trials 5 --output results/data/my_20vertex.json
        
